join ember (normal) right [animation="Fade In"]
ember: I want to say thank you. For not walking away yesterday.
ember: It would've been the easier thing to do.
ember: Most people take the easy thing.
[wait time="0.1"]
- Easier isn't always better.
	ember: Now that's a fortune cookie if I've ever heard one. (+24 Wit)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":24}"]
	ember: I'm putting that on a mug. Don't try to stop me.
	- Put my name on it too, then.
		ember: Only if you're paying for the mug. (+10 Wit)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"wit":10}"]
	- As long as it makes you smile.
		ember: It does. Every time. (+10 Charm)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":10}"]
- I don't walk away from things that matter.
	ember: I'm starting to actually believe that about you. (+24 Trust)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":24}"]
	ember: It's a strange feeling, believing something like that again.
	- Good strange, I hope.
		ember: Good strange. Definitely good strange. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
	- Take your time believing it. I'm not in a rush.
		ember (sad): That patience means more than you realize. (Vulnerability risk)
		do GameManager.apply_vulnerability_risk(10, 0.75)
		if {last_vulnerability_success} == true:
			ember: Not many people offer that kind of patience.
		else:
			ember (sad): I hope I don't need too much time. I want to just trust it.
- You're worth staying for.
	ember: You have a real talent for saying exactly the right thing. (+24 Charm)
	[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":24}"]
	ember (smug): Careful, I might start expecting that daily.
	- Get used to it, then.
		ember: Oh, I fully intend to. (+10 Charm)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"charm":10}"]
	- I mean it every time I say it.
		ember: That's what makes it land. (+10 Trust)
		[signal arg_type="dict" arg="{"trust":10}"]
ember: Whatever's coming next, let's keep proving it. One day at a time.
do GameManager.end_dialauge()